                "text": "On #WorldFoodDay, we\u2019re reminded that too many of our neighbors in NW Ohio face empty shelves and growing hardship. Food banks are stretched thin, rents are rising, and health care is becoming inaccessible. Every person deserves access to nourishment. Full stop. https://t.co/8qfEXuMVQE",
