                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At @SpeakerJohnson newser, I wanted to find out why the GOP are denying SNAP food assistance for more than 42 Million nationwide and keeping the government shut down rather than protecting health care prices from skyrocketing over 200% for working families. He scurried out the side door.",
                "text_lang": "en",
