                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I returned to Washington. As the government shutdown is into its 30th day the vast majority of my colleagues are not here. If Congress doesn't act, millions of Americans will see their health care premiums double or even triple, and 42 million Americans will lose critical food assistance.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1761870628,
                "view_count": 1810
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "581141508",
                "author_username": "RepMarcyKaptur",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1984732154945790308",
                "created_time": "2025-11-01T21:19:54",
                "favorite_count": 72,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1984732154945790308",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "quote",
                "quote_count": 6,
                "quoted_status_id": "1984452289428685215",
                "quoted_status_profile_id": "1243560408025198593",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "MeidasTouch",
                "reply_count": 78,
                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The government has been shut down for a month, health care costs are skyrocketing, food benefits are being withheld from tens of millions. What\u2019s the President doing? Throwing a fancy party at his private club for Billionaires and Millionaires.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762031994,
                "view_count": 5297
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": null,
                "attached_medias_url": null,
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "581141508",
                "author_username": "RepMarcyKaptur",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1985760893846815035",
                "created_time": "2025-11-04T17:27:45",
                "favorite_count": 22,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1985760893846815035",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "quote",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": "1985741301560602995",
                "quoted_status_profile_id": "15463671",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "samstein",
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are a nation of laws. I share the President\u2019s desire to get government open again, and I\u2019m ready to negotiate to ensure millions don\u2019t lose health coverage, but the shutdown does not give him the authority to shut off food assistance to millions of working Americans. Court orders must be obeyed.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762277265,
                "view_count": 1833
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5AKrQ6W0AAgt4E.jpg?name=small"
                ],
                "attached_medias_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5AKrQ6W0AAgt4E.jpg"
                ],
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "581141508",
                "author_username": "RepMarcyKaptur",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986099177906999354",
                "created_time": "2025-11-05T15:51:58",
                "favorite_count": 18,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986099177906999354",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Grocery prices keep going up, childcare and rent are unaffordable, and health insurance rates are about to skyrocket. This is just one of many NW Ohio constituents I am fighting for every single day. We must do everything within our power to bring costs down for those just trying to make ends meet.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762357918,
                "view_count": 938
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5Fs-aJXcAAP7yf.jpg?name=small"
                ],
                "attached_medias_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5Fs-aJXcAAP7yf.jpg"
                ],
                "attached_videos": null,
                "author_id": "581141508",
                "author_username": "RepMarcyKaptur",
                "community_notes": null,
                "conversation_id": "1986488733462675579",
                "created_time": "2025-11-06T17:39:55",
                "favorite_count": 19,
                "geo_lat": null,
                "geo_lon": null,
                "id": "1986488733462675579",
                "in_reply_to_post_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_id": null,
                "in_reply_to_profile_username": null,
                "place_country_code": null,
                "place_country_name": null,
                "place_full_name": null,
                "place_type": null,
                "poll": null,
                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 0,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The ACA has changed lives and expanded care to many who had been left out in the cold. I will not stop fighting to help feed our neighbors, turn SNAP benefits back on, and to make sure that those tens of millions of Americans most in need of health care can afford it. This is a life and death issue.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762450795,
                "view_count": 851
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5LO26CXkAI0ZPR.jpg?name=small"
                ],
                "attached_medias_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G5LO26CXkAI0ZPR.jpg"
